  - m_Id: 3698319399
    m_Localized: Contact with the battery has been lost. Reach the junction and call headquarters. Restore both feeds, escort three wagons to the hospital and hold the battery.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3698319400
    m_Localized: A trench leads from the hospital to the telephone. The lowland muster point is closer, but a mask is essential there. A charge at the casemate door [E] will raise the alarm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
