    m_Localized: "{0} \xB7 right-click or press Delete to remove."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3702513669
    m_Localized: Empty position. Click or press Enter to deploy the selected soldier.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3702513670
    m_Localized: "{0} \xB7 {1} \xB7 {2:0} m\n{3}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3702513671
    m_Localized: Hold Q to set jump distance. Release to jump or clear wire. You can still fire.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3702513672
    m_Localized: "Press Q to raise the periscope. Left-click to mark a target for two turns and increase the squad\u2019s rifle damage against it by 20%. After a turn without attacking, your next shot from 10 m deals double damage."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3702513673
    m_Localized: Press Q for 4 m of extra movement. You can still fire this turn.
