  - m_Id: 51949515825152
    m_Localized: The western trench leads from the field hospital to the telephone. From the central trench, follow the duckboards to the junction. Wear a mask in the lowland beyond the telephone. A charge at the casemate door [E] will raise the alarm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51949582934016
    m_Localized: Central trench
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51949582934017
    m_Localized: From the field hospital, follow the trench to the last turn before the telephone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51949582934018
    m_Localized: Follow the duckboards through the bend, then turn right for the telephone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51949582934019
    m_Localized: Select a soldier and choose an open position on the map.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 59219725246464
    m_Localized: Q opens the periscope. Left-click to mark an enemy for two turns (+20% rifle damage). Spend your activation without moving or attacking to double your next shot from 10 m. Maximum damage is 84, or 24 on a helmet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 59219813326848
    m_Localized: Q adds 6 m. After firing, Hound can spend the rest of her movement. One shot per turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 59219817521152
    m_Localized: "\xBB  Observation"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 59219817521153
    m_Localized: "\xD72 at 10 m \xB7 max 84"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 59219817521154
    m_Localized: "Hound   \u2022   Added 6 m"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 59219817521155
